Electric4k

This project includes Kotlin adaptations of algorithms and test expectations from
Electric, https://github.com/electric-sql/electric,
@electric-sql/client 1.5.28, commit 3f9809fb0bd894cb74470d434749673492ad7acf.
Upstream is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Copyright (c) ElectricSQL / Electric authors and contributors.

Adaptations include synchronization state transitions, Shape materialization,
column mapping, expression compilation, PostgreSQL parsing, snapshot visibility
and transaction wraparound, protocol cache handling, and stream recovery.
The generated Upstream*Vectors.kt fixtures are derived by executing upstream code.
These adaptations and the Kotlin transport/lifecycle implementation were modified
for Kotlin Multiplatform. The upstream server implementation is not included.
